  "ingredients": [
    "1 (12 pound) whole turkey",
    "6 tablespoons butter, divided",
    "4 cups warm water",
    "3 tablespoons chicken bouillon",
    "2 tablespoons dried parsley",
    "2 tablespoons dried minced onion",
    "2 tablespoons seasoning salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Rinse and wash turkey. Discard the giblets, or add to pan if they are anyone's favorites.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9UoMY4ub76ukgf8Xi4RL8mON_nw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13464-homestyle-turkey-the-michigander-way-VAT-step-01-3e0ec5efb01145f58c840934b1099500.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13464/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place turkey in a Dutch oven or roasting pan. Separate the skin over the breast to make little pockets. Put 3 tablespoons of the butter on both sides between the skin and breast meat. This makes for very juicy breast meat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NyqbHfe4oUv9SsVr72u1Gj_KgFU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13464-homestyle-turkey-the-michigander-way-VAT-step-02-262d01befe6449e7942215f2e5a53662.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13464/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine the water with the bouillon. Sprinkle in the parsley and minced onion. Pour over the top of the turkey. Sprinkle seasoning salt over the turkey.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-SMcqADcqFeNDsXdKtFe2kVh1Cw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13464-homestyle-turkey-the-michigander-way-VAT-step-03-d9e2853fb53a4a4b93fb3898996d50b4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13464/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover with foil, and bake in the preheated oven 3 1/2 to 4 hours, until the internal temperature of the turkey reaches 180 degrees F (80 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EqIjSkJMUbUMiq0SL2YVk0e_aBg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13464-homestyle-turkey-the-michigander-way-VAT-step-04-4da3ddfe8a8e4066ac46369fb279fe60.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13464/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "For the last 45 minutes or so, remove the foil so the turkey will brown nicely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DzOHYB48wMY-c8d-2EYgTvYoI-k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13464-homestyle-turkey-the-michigander-way-VAT-step-05-24f192f3162a4b8cb1aa515493c671c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13464/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vv9C8TfI0KG8jxUK5QywF3HwSo0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13464-homestyle-turkey-the-michigander-way-VAT-Beauty-4x3-e131945996d04581991406041d06bace.jpg"
      ],
